contentText:
The Game reveals that there are multiple versions of the song &#8220;No Brakes&#8221; which features Drake .

During a recent appearance on Real 92.3 LA’s  The Cruz Show , The Game alluded to there being a verse that he decided to take off after host J. Cruz asked if Drake originally had a verse on the Documentary III single. “I don’t know. Maybe,” The Game replied before suggesting he decided not use the Toronto rapper&#8217;s verse for the sake of peace.

